The following is a list of squads for all 12 national teams that competed at the [[2019 Copa América]]. Each national team had to submit a final squad of 23 players, 3 of whom had to be goalkeepers.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.conmebol.com/sites/default/files/reglamento-ca2019.pdf |title=CONMEBOL Copa América Brasil 2019: Reglamento |trans-title=CONMEBOL Copa América Brazil 2019: Regulations |publisher=CONMEBOL |date=26 April 2019 |access-date=29 April 2019 |language=es |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190502035320/http://www.conmebol.com/sites/default/files/reglamento-ca2019.pdf |archive-date=2 May 2019}}</ref>

On 31 May 2019 CONMEBOL published the lists of the twelve teams.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.conmebol.com/es/listas-oficiales-de-las-12-selecciones-de-la-conmebol-copa-america-brasil-2019|title=Listas Oficiales de las 12 selecciones de la CONMEBOL Copa América - Brasil 2019|publisher=CONMEBOL.com|date=31 May 2019|language=es}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.conmebol.com/sites/default/files/ca2019_convocados1.pdf|title=CONMEBOL Copa América Brasil 2019 NOMINA DE JUGADORES|website=CONMEBOL.com|publisher=Confederación Sudamericana de Fútbol|date=31 May 2019|language=es}}</ref>

==Group A==
===Brazil===
Head coach: [[Tite (football manager)|Tite]]

The 23-man squad was announced on 17 May 2019.<ref>{{cite web |title=Seleção Brasileira: convocados por Tite para a Copa América 2019 |url=https://www.cbf.com.br/selecao-brasileira/noticias/selecao-masculina/selecao-brasileira-convocada-por-tite-para-a-copa-america-2019 |publisher=CBF |access-date=18 May 2019 |date=17 May 2019|language=pt}}</ref> On 6 June, [[Neymar]] withdrew due to an injury and was replaced by [[Willian (footballer, born 1988)|Willian]].<ref>{{cite web |title=Neymar Jr. está desconvocado da Seleção Brasileira |url=https://www.cbf.com.br/selecao-brasileira/noticias/selecao-masculina/neymar-jr-esta-desconvocado-da-selecao-brasileira |publisher=CBF |access-date=6 June 2019 |date=6 June 2019|language=pt}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Willian está convocado para a Copa América 2019 |url=https://www.cbf.com.br/selecao-brasileira/noticias/selecao-masculina/willian-esta-convocado-para-a-copa-america-2019 |publisher=CBF |access-date=7 June 2019 |date=7 June 2019|language=pt }}</ref>

